      {
        "id": "major-question-01",
        "label": "大問Ⅰ",
        "order": 1,
        "sourcePageIds": [
          "juntendo-2025-general-a-mathematics-questions-p001",
          "juntendo-2025-general-a-mathematics-questions-p002"
        ],
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>Ⅰ　小問集合</h2><h3>（1）数列と無限級数</h3><p class=\"prose\">一般項が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a_n=2^{n+3}3^{-n}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a_n=2^{n+3}3^{-n}</span> で与えられる数列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\{a_n\\}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\{a_n\\}</span> について、</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a_n&lt;1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a_n&lt;1</span> を満たす最小の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n</span> の値は <span class=\"answer-slot\">ア</span> である。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\">また、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n=\\boxed{\\text{イウ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n=\\boxed{\\text{イウ}}</span> である。</div></div></div><p class=\"prose\">一般項が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b_n=a_1\\times a_2\\times\\cdots\\times a_n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">b_n=a_1\\times a_2\\times\\cdots\\times a_n</span> で与えられる数列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\{b_n\\}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\{b_n\\}</span> について、</p><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b_n&lt;1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">b_n&lt;1</span> を満たす最小の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n</span> の値は <span class=\"answer-slot\">エオ</span> である。</p><p class=\"prose\">ただし、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\log_{10}2=0.3010\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\log_{10}2=0.3010</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\log_{10}3=0.4771\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\log_{10}3=0.4771</span> とする。</p><h3>（2）空間ベクトル</h3><p class=\"prose\">四面体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OABC\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OABC</span> において、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\angle AOB=\\angle BOC=\\angle AOC=60^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\angle AOB=\\angle BOC=\\angle AOC=60^\\circ</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OA=9\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OA=9</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OB=3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OB=3</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OC=6\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OC=6</span> である。</p><p class=\"prose\">点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P\" data-display-mode=\"false\">P</span> は辺 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OA\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OA</span> 上を、点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q\" data-display-mode=\"false\">Q</span> は辺 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BC\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BC</span> 上をそれぞれ独立に動く。</p><p class=\"prose\">このとき、線分 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"PQ\" data-display-mode=\"false\">PQ</span> を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2:1</span> に内分する点を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\">R</span> とする。</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{OP}=s\\overrightarrow{OA}\\ (0\\le s\\le1),\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OQ}=(1-t)\\overrightarrow{OB}+t\\overrightarrow{OC}\\ (0\\le t\\le1)\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\overrightarrow{OP}=s\\overrightarrow{OA}\\ (0\\le s\\le1),\\qquad \\overrightarrow{OQ}=(1-t)\\overrightarrow{OB}+t\\overrightarrow{OC}\\ (0\\le t\\le1)</div><p class=\"prose\">辺 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OB\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OB</span> を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2:1</span> に内分する点を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"D\" data-display-mode=\"false\">D</span> とすると、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{DR}=s\\vec{k}+t\\vec{l}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\overrightarrow{DR}=s\\vec{k}+t\\vec{l}</span> であり、</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\vec{k}=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ア}}}{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}\\overrightarrow{OA}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\vec{k}=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ア}}}{\\boxed{\\text{イ}}}\\overrightarrow{OA}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\vec{l}=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{エ}}}\\overrightarrow{OC}-\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{オ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{カ}}}\\overrightarrow{OB}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\vec{l}=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{エ}}}\\overrightarrow{OC}-\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{オ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{カ}}}\\overrightarrow{OB}</span> と表される。</div></div></div><p class=\"prose\">点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\">R</span> はある平面上を動くことがわかる。この平面を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"H\" data-display-mode=\"false\">H</span> とすると、</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\vec{k}|^2=\\boxed{\\text{キ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\vec{k}|^2=\\boxed{\\text{キ}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\vec{l}|^2=\\boxed{\\text{クケ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\vec{l}|^2=\\boxed{\\text{クケ}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\vec{k}\\cdot\\vec{l}=\\boxed{\\text{コ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\vec{k}\\cdot\\vec{l}=\\boxed{\\text{コ}}</span> より、</div></div></div><p class=\"prose\">平面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"H\" data-display-mode=\"false\">H</span> 上で点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\">R</span> が描く図形の面積は <span class=\"answer-slot\">サ</span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{シス}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{シス}}}</span> である。</p><h3>（3）4次方程式</h3><p class=\"prose\">4次方程式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P(x)=x^4-54x^2-40x+269=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">P(x)=x^4-54x^2-40x+269=0</span> を考える。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=y+b\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=y+b</span> とおいたとき、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P(y+b)=y^4-4y^3-48y^2+64y+256\" data-display-mode=\"false\">P(y+b)=y^4-4y^3-48y^2+64y+256</span> となる定数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b\" data-display-mode=\"false\">b</span> の値は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b=\\boxed{\\text{アイ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">b=\\boxed{\\text{アイ}}</span> である。</p><p class=\"prose\">さらに <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=az\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=az</span> とおいて、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P(az+b)=cz^4-cz^3+dz^2+cz+c\" data-display-mode=\"false\">P(az+b)=cz^4-cz^3+dz^2+cz+c</span> となるように定数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a</span> を選ぶと <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a=\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a=\\boxed{\\text{ウ}}</span> であり、このとき <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"c=\\boxed{\\text{エオカ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">c=\\boxed{\\text{エオカ}}</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d=\\boxed{\\text{キクケコ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">d=\\boxed{\\text{キクケコ}}</span> である。</p><p class=\"prose\">方程式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P(az+b)=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">P(az+b)=0</span> において、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=z-\\dfrac1z\" data-display-mode=\"false\">t=z-\\dfrac1z</span> とおくと <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{サ}}\\pm\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{シ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ス}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">t=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{サ}}\\pm\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{シ}}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ス}}}</span> である。方程式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P(x)=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">P(x)=0</span> の実数解のうち最大のものは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{セ}}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ソタ}}+\\boxed{\\text{チ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{セ}}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ソタ}}+\\boxed{\\text{チ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{ツ}}}}</span> である。</p><h3>（4）必要条件・十分条件</h3><p class=\"prose\">次の <span class=\"answer-slot\">ア</span>〜<span class=\"answer-slot\">エ</span> に当てはまるものを、（A）〜（D）から選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--questions\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">（a）</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">実数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x</span> について、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0&lt;|x+2|-|x-1|&lt;3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">0&lt;|x+2|-|x-1|&lt;3</span> は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-1&lt;x&lt;1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-1&lt;x&lt;1</span> であるための <span class=\"answer-slot\">ア</span>。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">（b）</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">実数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x</span> が有理数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a,b\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a,b</span> を用いて <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a^b\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a^b</span> と表せることは、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x</span> が有理数であるための <span class=\"answer-slot\">イ</span>。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">（c）</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">無限級数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n</span> が収束することは、数列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\{a_n\\}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\{a_n\\}</span> が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=0</span> を満たすための <span class=\"answer-slot\">ウ</span>。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">（d）</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m,n,l\" data-display-mode=\"false\">m,n,l</span> を整数とする。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m^2+n^2+l^2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">m^2+n^2+l^2</span> が奇数であることは、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m+n+l\" data-display-mode=\"false\">m+n+l</span> が奇数であるための <span class=\"answer-slot\">エ</span>。</div></div></div><div class=\"table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"source-table\"><caption>選択肢</caption><thead><tr><th>記号</th><th>内容</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>（A）</td><td>必要十分条件である</td></tr><tr><td>（B）</td><td>必要条件であるが、十分条件ではない</td></tr><tr><td>（C）</td><td>十分条件であるが、必要条件ではない</td></tr><tr><td>（D）</td><td>必要条件でも十分条件でもない</td></tr></tbody></table></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "大問Ⅱ",
        "order": 2,
        "sourcePageIds": [
          "juntendo-2025-general-a-mathematics-questions-p003"
        ],
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>Ⅱ　3次関数と接線</h2><p class=\"prose\">3次関数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)=ax^3+bx^2+cx+d\\ (a\\ne0)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)=ax^3+bx^2+cx+d\\ (a\\ne0)</span> について、以下の（a）、（b）、（c）それぞれの場合における定数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a,b,c,d\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a,b,c,d</span> の値を求めよ。</p><h3>（a）</h3><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--conditions\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">条件（i）：</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=f(x)</span> のグラフは直線 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=6x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=6x</span> と3個の共有点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(-2,-12),(1,6),(4,24)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(-2,-12),(1,6),(4,24)</span> を持つ。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">条件（ii）：</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)</span> の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=-2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=-2</span> における微分係数が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-3</span> である。</div></div></div><p class=\"prose\">条件（i）より <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)-6x=a(x+\\boxed{\\text{ア}})(x-\\boxed{\\text{イ}})(x-\\boxed{\\text{ウ}})\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)-6x=a(x+\\boxed{\\text{ア}})(x-\\boxed{\\text{イ}})(x-\\boxed{\\text{ウ}})</span> となる。</p><p class=\"prose\">ただし、<span class=\"answer-slot\">イ</span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"&lt;\" data-display-mode=\"false\">&lt;</span><span class=\"answer-slot\">ウ</span> である。</p><p class=\"prose\">さらに条件（ii）を考慮して、</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{エオ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{カ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{エオ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{カ}}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{キ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ク}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">b=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{キ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ク}}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"c=\\boxed{\\text{ケ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">c=\\boxed{\\text{ケ}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d=\\boxed{\\text{コサ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">d=\\boxed{\\text{コサ}}</span> を得る。</div></div></div><h3>（b）</h3><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--conditions\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">条件（i）：</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=f(x)</span> のグラフは直線 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=6x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=6x</span> と点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(1,6)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(1,6)</span> で接し、かつ共有点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(4,24)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(4,24)</span> を持つ。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">条件（ii）：</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=f(x)</span> のグラフは直線 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=6x-12\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=6x-12</span> と接する。</div></div></div><p class=\"prose\">このとき、</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a=\\boxed{\\text{シ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a=\\boxed{\\text{シ}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b=\\boxed{\\text{スセソ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">b=\\boxed{\\text{スセソ}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"c=\\boxed{\\text{タチ}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">c=\\boxed{\\text{タチ}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d=\\boxed{\\text{ツテト}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">d=\\boxed{\\text{ツテト}}</span> である。</div></div></div><h3>（c）</h3><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--conditions\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">条件（i）：</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=f(x)</span> のグラフは直線 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=6x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=6x</span> と点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(1,6)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(1,6)</span> で接し、他に共有点はない。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">条件（ii）：</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)</span> は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=-3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=-3</span> で極値をとる。</div></div></div><p class=\"prose\">このとき、</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ナニ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ヌ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ナニ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ヌ}}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"b=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ネ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ノ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">b=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ネ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ノ}}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"c=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ハヒ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{フ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">c=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ハヒ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{フ}}}</span>、</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ヘ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ホ}}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">d=\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{ヘ}}}{\\boxed{\\text{ホ}}}</span> である。</div></div></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "大問Ⅲ",
        "order": 3,
