        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>Ⅲ　定積分と無限級数</h2><p class=\"prose\">0以上の整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n</span> に対して</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"I_n=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\tan^{2n+1}x\\,dx\" data-display-mode=\"true\">I_n=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\tan^{2n+1}x\\,dx</div><p class=\"prose\">とする。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--questions\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">（1）</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">I_0</span> を求めよ。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">（2）</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\\ge1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">n\\ge1</span> のとき、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I_n=(-1)^n\\left(I_0+\\sum_{m=1}^{n}\\dfrac{(-1)^m}{2m}\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">I_n=(-1)^n\\left(I_0+\\sum_{m=1}^{n}\\dfrac{(-1)^m}{2m}\\right)</span> が成り立つことを数学的帰納法によって示せ。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">（3）</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\log2=-\\sum_{m=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^m}{m}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\log2=-\\sum_{m=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^m}{m}</span> を示せ。ただし、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0\\le x\\le\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">0\\le x\\le\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}</span> において、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0\\le\\tan x\\le\\dfrac4\\pi x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">0\\le\\tan x\\le\\dfrac4\\pi x</span> が成り立つことを用いてよい。</div></div></div></article>"
      }
